{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bb539a24-8877-8650-b465-a01492a3644b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:32:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Kevin. Liam Brennan. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this line. Somebody told me this is the one to use on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:27:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this one's monitored for storm stuff. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The drain out front of my place is backed up. I'm at 245 Kingston Avenue, up on the Hill. After that nor'easter that ended yesterday, the whole apron at the end of the driveway is holding water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "245 Kingston Avenue. Okay, and when you say holding water, how bad are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a puddle the size of a small pond. Up to the hubcaps on my car. I measured it with the car, basically. And here's the thing, it doesn't go out to the street, it runs the wrong way. Pitches right toward the garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Toward the garage. Okay, so it's pooling at the bottom of the driveway and draining back at the house. Let me write that down. Is any water getting in the garage yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. It's sitting at the door. But it's been like this since yesterday afternoon, and the rain stopped hours ago. So it's not draining. Something's plugged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sounds like the catch basin's clogged, leaves or debris maybe. Is the grate on the street visible, or is it buried?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:28:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Visible. It's covered with leaves and junk though, a mat of them. I'm not climbing in the street in this to pull them off, either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, don't do that. Stay out of the road. Okay, leaves on the grate, water standing, running toward the garage. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So what I want to know is when did they last come by? Somebody from the city clean these? Because I haven't seen a truck on this stretch of Kingston Avenue in I don't know how long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I can't see the cleaning schedule from this screen. I can see if there's a past work order for that address or that basin, give me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:29:47-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm not finding a recent entry under that address. That doesn't necessarily mean nobody was ever there, it might be logged by the street section instead. I can put in a note asking them to check the last service date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, put that in. I'd like an answer on that. Because if it's been years, that's the story right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. I'll flag it as standing water with a request for the last cleaning date. And I'll mark it as a weekend call after the storm so it gets looked at with the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And look, it's not just me. There's a family two doors down, they just had a baby, like a couple weeks old. They've got the car seat, going in and out, and that water's right there where they walk. It's no good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's worth noting. Slippery and cold, with a newborn. I'll put in that there's a safety concern for pedestrians too. If it freezes tonight it'll be worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly what I was thinking. Temperature's dropping. That'll be a skating rink at the bottom of the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Okay, so I've got standing water at the driveway apron, about hubcap deep, draining toward the garage, grate covered with leaves, nor'easter yesterday. Anything else I should add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that I'd like somebody out sooner rather than later. Monday, ideally. I'm not asking for a miracle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise a day, crews are stretched after a storm like that, but it goes in the queue today and the street crew will see it first thing Monday. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-four. Liam Brennan. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's me. And you'll get back to me on when they last cleaned it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that right at the top of the note so whoever picks it up knows you want that answer. If it's not me calling, it'll be someone from the department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I appreciate you taking it on a Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Keep clear of that water if you can, and tell your neighbors to watch their step tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:32:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care."
    }
  ],
